- Concrete files/symbols, contracts, callers to migrate, obsolete code to remove, and observable acceptance evidence.
- Update affected tests/docs while respecting repository policy on when checks may execute.
- Separate implemented, built, deployed, and verified status.
- No scaffolding, compatibility shims, or partial transport swap presented as completion.

Report genuine unresolved questions only after exhausting repository evidence. Finish with the spec paths, preload completion/blockers, and remaining design blockers. Stop before implementation.
